 '<div><h3>Help your business adapt.</h3><p>You know the business. Bring the friction, the bottleneck or the idea. Explore how a partnership could connect it with the right people and technology.</p>'+link('Explore business partnerships','pages/partnerships.html#businesses')+'</div><aside class="route-aside"><p class="small">Start with the problem you need to solve.</p><ul><li>Repetitive work and disconnected processes</li><li>Ideas that need design or a prototype</li><li>A team trying to make sense of AI</li></ul></aside>',
 '<div><h3>Build a school with purpose.</h3><p>Bring a community and a commitment to its future. Explore a school model that gives the arts, technology and academics a central place in education.</p>'+link('Explore the River Tech model','pages/river-tech.html#licensing')+'</div><aside class="route-aside"><p class="small">For founders and prospective school operators.</p><ul><li>Understand the educational concept</li><li>See the model in Post Falls</li><li>Discuss licensing and local fit</li></ul></aside>',
 '<div><h3>Help build the next chapter.</h3><p>See how Tink Town can start small, what each phase could cost and how property, equipment or capital could help turn the plan into useful local work.</p>'+link('Explore investing','pages/investing.html')+'</div><aside class="route-aside"><p class="small">An invitation to an exploratory conversation.</p><ul><li>Understand the vision and current stage</li><li>Compare the Tink Town launch phases</li><li>Explore your potential involvement</li></ul></aside>'
