render('home','Education and enterprise for a changing world','River Tech LLC develops River Tech and Tink Town: sister brands connecting education, human talent and emerging technology.',f'''
<section class="home-hero"><div class="hero-lines" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="wrap hero-content"><span class="eyebrow light">River Tech LLC · Idaho</span><h1>A changing world.<br>People ready to shape it.</h1><p class="lead">River Tech prepares the next generation to create, lead and solve problems. Tink Town is our next venture: bringing human talent and emerging technology together to help businesses adapt.</p><p class="hero-foot">Grounded in Christian faith, Idaho values and practical enterprise.</p></div><div class="path-bar"><div class="wrap path-inner"><span class="path-label">Start here</span><a href="#shared-vision">Discover the vision <span class="arrow">↓</span></a><a href="pages/river-tech.html">Explore River Tech <span class="arrow">↗</span></a><a href="pages/tink-town.html">Explore Tink Town <span class="arrow">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="section shared-vision" id="shared-vision"><div class="wrap"><div class="intro-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">Prepared to move forward</span><h2>Tomorrow starts<br>with who we prepare.</h2></div><div><p class="lead">The future needs people who can combine human judgment, creativity and leadership with powerful new technology. Businesses need those capabilities today. The next generation needs to develop them for tomorrow.</p><p>River Tech and Tink Town bring those two needs into one shared vision: preparing capable people and putting capability to work.</p></div></div><div class="readiness-line"><span>See what is changing.</span><span>Build the capability.</span><span>Move forward together.</span></div></div></section>
<section class="bridge-section"><div class="wrap bridge-inner"><div><span class="eyebrow">Confidence through preparation</span><h2>The future is changing.<br>We’re building for it.</h2></div><div><p>New technology can unsettle a business. It can also open doors. Our approach is to meet change directly: understand what matters, learn the tools and find a useful way forward.</p><p>We are building a place for people who want to take that approach together. Practical skills, creative thinking and a shared commitment to work that serves others.</p>{link('Meet our two brands','#our-brands')}</div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">Human talent. Emerging technology.</span><h2>Keep people<br>at the center.</h2></div><p>Tools will keep changing. Judgment, character, creativity and the ability to work with others remain essential.</p></div><figure class="concept-panorama" style="margin:0"><img src="assets/images/tink-town-concept.png" width="2172" height="724" loading="lazy" alt="Concept illustration of people sharing ideas, working with technology and building together"><figcaption class="caption"><span>The Tink Town vision: people, ideas and practical work in one place.</span><span>Concept illustration · In development</span></figcaption></figure><section class="mission-bridge" aria-labelledby="mission-bridge-title"><h2 id="mission-bridge-title">River Tech develops <span style="white-space:nowrap">problem-solvers.</span> Tink Town puts <span style="white-space:nowrap">problem-solvers</span> to work.</h2><p>Our mission has two parts. <strong>River Tech</strong> is our school concept: preparing creative, capable graduates to put AI, automation and robotics to work, grounded in Christian faith and Idaho values. <strong>Tink Town</strong> is our business concept: bringing skilled people together to solve real problems for businesses and the community, from everyday improvements to ambitious moonshots.</p><p class="mission-guide">Explore our two concepts below, or discover how you could help build them here in North Idaho.</p></section><div class="brand-pair" id="our-brands"><article><span class="eyebrow">River Tech</span><h3>Developing the people.</h3><p>Our school concept brings the arts, technology and academics together, grounded in Christian faith and Idaho values. We develop capable problem-solvers who use emerging technology, take responsibility and contribute to their communities.</p>{link('Explore the school concept','pages/river-tech.html')}</article><article><span class="eyebrow">Tink Town</span><h3>Putting capability to work.</h3><p>Our business concept brings skilled people and emerging technology together to solve problems for businesses and communities. From improvements to ambitious moonshots, we are building a place where talent becomes useful work.</p>{link('Visit Tink Town','https://tink.town/')}</article><article><span class="eyebrow">Explore investing</span><h3>Big ideas. Close to home.</h3><p>We love following SpaceX, Nvidia and the wider market. But imagine seeing your investment help local talent flourish, local businesses adapt and good ideas become useful work—right here where you live.</p>{link('Explore investing','pages/investing.html')}</article></div></div></section>
<section class="section pathways" id="your-path"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Find your next step</span><h2>What do you want to build?</h2>{tabs('your-path',['A stronger business','A River Tech school','Local investment'],homepanels)}</div></section>
<section><div class="wrap values"><h3>Rooted here.<br>Looking ahead.</h3><p>Our Christian faith shapes how we treat people and how we work. Our Idaho roots keep us close to practical skills, personal responsibility, community and the value of building something useful.</p></div></section>
{cta('Face what comes next. Build with us.','Start a conversation','pages/contact.html')}
''')

render('river-tech','River Tech — the school concept','A Christian school model integrating performing arts, technology and core academics. Explore the concept, current schools and licensing.',hero('River Tech · A sister brand of River Tech LLC','Prepare people.<br>Not just résumés.','A school model for a world that needs people who can think clearly, communicate well and turn ideas into useful work.')+'''
<nav class="jump-nav" aria-label="On this page"><div class="wrap"><a href="#model">The model</a><a href="#pillars">Three pillars</a><a href="#schools">Current schools</a><a href="#licensing">Start a school</a><a href="community.html#colleges">College partnerships ↗</a></div></nav>
<section class="section" id="model"><div class="wrap brand-feature"><div><span class="eyebrow">The River Tech approach</span><h2>Human ability.<br>Technical fluency.</h2><p class="lead" style="margin-top:25px">Emerging technology changes the tools. Education still has to develop the person who uses them.</p><p style="margin-top:20px">River Tech combines creative expression, practical technology and rigorous learning within a Christian framework. The ambition is graduates prepared for responsibility, collaboration and work that matters.</p></div><figure style="margin:0"><div class="photo"><img src="../assets/images/photos/Girls_Building_Robot.jpg" alt="Two students collaborating on a robotics project"></div><figcaption class="caption">Making technology a hands-on discipline.</figcaption></figure></div></section>
<section class="section tint-section" id="pillars"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Three pillars, held together</span><h2>A broader foundation<br>for a changing future.</h2><div class="three-up"><article class="principle"><span class="number">01 / EXPRESSION</span><h3>Performing arts</h3><p>Music, theater and performance make collaboration, discipline and communication something students practice.</p></article><article class="principle"><span class="number">02 / MAKING</span><h3>Technology</h3><p>Coding, robotics, design and digital creation turn technology into a means of building, rather than simply consuming.</p></article><article class="principle"><span class="number">03 / UNDERSTANDING</span><h3>Core academics</h3><p>Mathematics, language, science, history and Bible give students knowledge to draw on and ideas worth examining.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap intro-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">The experience</span><h2>A model built<br>around people.</h2></div><div><p class="lead">The arts, technology and academics belong together. So do faith, family and community.</p><div class="list-rows"><article class="list-row"><h3>Mastery matters</h3><p>Students work toward understanding, with learning that recognizes different strengths and rates of progress.</p></article><article class="list-row"><h3>More than one way to belong</h3><p>The concept brings full-time schooling and à la carte homeschool enrichment into a shared community.</p></article><article class="list-row"><h3>Faith in daily life</h3><p>A Christian foundation connects learning with character, service and responsibility.</p></article></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section tint-section" id="schools"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Current schools</span><h2>The first chapter:<br>Post Falls, Idaho.</h2><div class="school-list"><img src="../assets/images/photos/Music_Class.jpg" alt="Music class at River Tech in Post Falls" loading="lazy"><div><h3>River Tech School of<br>Performing Arts & Technology</h3><p>The River Tech concept is in practice in Post Falls. This school is operated by Faithful Five Inc., a nonprofit, under license from River Tech LLC.</p><p>The wider vision is for additional schools, each with its own responsible operator and local community.</p>'''+link('Visit the Post Falls school','https://rivertechschool.com')+'''<p class="small" style="margin-top:18px">Enrollment and family information are available through the school.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="licensing"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Start a River Tech school</span><h2>Bring River Tech<br>to your community.</h2><p class="lead" style="max-width:760px;margin-top:25px">Build a locally operated school around the River Tech name and educational concept, with guidance from the founders. A licence gives you a shared foundation while you lead your school.</p>'''+build_concept_story()+'''<div class="list-rows"><div class="list-row"><h3>What you receive</h3><div><p>Permission to use the agreed River Tech name and branding, the school concept and consultation with Dan and Mary Hegelund on putting it into practice.</p><p>The concept brings Christian faith, academics, performing arts and technology together with preparation for adult life.</p></div></div><div class="list-row"><h3>What you lead</h3><p>Your organization operates the school. You choose staff, salaries, tuition, budgets and daily arrangements, and take responsibility for your premises and local requirements. River Tech LLC protects the brand and checks the agreed concept standards.</p></div><div class="list-row"><h3>What we agree</h3><p>A written licence identifies your approved campus, concept standards, fees and support. The licence is nonexclusive; additional campuses need written approval. We discuss the terms for your school before you commit.</p></div></div><h3 style="margin-top:40px">From interest to opening</h3><ol class="steps"><li><h3>Tell us your idea</h3><p>Share your community, experience and the school you want to build.</p></li><li><h3>Explore the fit</h3><p>Discuss the concept, your plans and what it would take to make the school work locally.</p></li><li><h3>Agree, then prepare</h3><p>Settle the licence and responsibilities before advertising or opening your River Tech school.</p></li></ol><div class="journey-links"><a href="investing.html#property">Explore our school space plans ↗</a><a href="investing.html#equipment">Explore equipment needs ↗</a></div></div></section>'''+cta('The next school starts with a conversation.','Talk about your community','contact.html?topic=school'))

