 '<div><span class="eyebrow">A business challenge</span><p class="example-quote">“Our team spends hours copying the same information.”</p></div><div><h3>Start with the work.</h3><p style="margin-top:15px">Map the process, understand the friction and explore whether software, automation or a better workflow could help.</p><p class="small">Illustrative Tink Town project. Services are in development.</p></div>',
